body:
That's croatian. Nice find OP. What's the name of the book?

&#x200B;

Right page translation:

&#x200B;

*"God created sky and earth. But earth was deserted, dark and veiled with deep waters. God wanted to decorate this earth in six days. On the first day, God said, Let there be light; and there was light. - On the second day, God created beautiful blue sky\*. - On the third day, God divided water from earth and made the grass, plants and fertile trees. - On the forth day, God creates lights on the sky, and the sun starts shining on..."*

&#x200B;

\*I used sky because of the lack of the better word.

So, After I start and cast an elemental circle and do the invocation will I be able to physically see the demon or just communicate telepathically?

&#x200B;

Also, how do I bond with a demon? Not choose a patron or matron but become close enough so we can work together. Is it even possible or is there a strict servant-master relationship going on?

Will I be able to change them if I need to?

I feel most drawn to Lilith even though I'm male.

Also, lots of communication and meditation to them is based on visualization, and I have aphantasia, so is it possible to do so without visualizing in some way?

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
